#: ../../docs/login/login-ssh.rst:34 fec2507622084362b66dcbcc23b1db41
msgid "SSH login without password"
msgstr "SSH login without password"

#: ../../docs/login/login-ssh.rst:36 4a819864f78140dc9df63b2e7b210c65
msgid ""
"SSH login without password requires a pair of keys, including a public key "
"and a private key, where the private key is placed on the user's local "
"machine, and the public key is placed on the cluster's\\ ``~/.ssh/"
"authorized_keys``\\ directory. When logging in next time, the private key on "
"the user's local machine and the public key on the remote cluster will be "
"verified through the encryption protocol. If the verification is successful, "
"the login will be successful without the need for a password. So here we "
"need to generate a pair of keys, and upload the public key to the specified "
"position of the target instance."
msgstr ""
"SSH login without password requires a pair of keys, including a public key "
"and a private key, where the private key is placed on the user's local "
"machine, and the public key is placed on the cluster's\\ ``~/.ssh/"
"authorized_keys``\\ directory. When logging in next time, the private key on "
"the user's local machine and the public key on the remote cluster will be "
"verified through the encryption protocol. If the verification is successful, "
"the login will be successful without the need for a password. So here we "
"need to generate a pair of keys, and upload the public key to the specified "
"position of the target instance."

